# Netlify reads this from the publish directory.
#
# Deliberately no Content-Security-Policy. A correct one has to allow the Firebase Auth and
# Firestore hosts, the Firestore streaming connection and Google Fonts — and getting it slightly
# wrong breaks sign-in *silently*, which is a bad trade. Worth adding later as its own task,
# with the network panel open.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
